@startuml
[*] --> System Ready
System Ready --> Order Summary Requested : User requests order summary
Order Summary Requested --> Retrieving Order Data : System starts retrieving data
Retrieving Order Data --> Order Data Retrieved : Data retrieval completed
Order Data Retrieved --> Displaying Order Summary : Display order summary
Displaying Order Summary --> Customizing View : User customizes view
Customizing View --> [*] : User exits
@enduml
